### VOCABULARY ACTIVITY
Review the term *function* as a rule that maps an element in the domain to an element in the range.

Show students the graph of the line $y = x + 1$.

Have students use the graph to identify an element in the domain and then use the graph to show how it is mapped to an element in the range. Then show students how to represent the same function shown by the graph, using function notation, $f(x) = x + 1$.

